# Kernel release 7.3.4-r<pkgrel>: each package revision gets its own
# /lib/modules directory. Modules carry BTF tied to the exact vmlinux
# (DEBUG_INFO_BTF_MODULES), so another build's modules never load; with a
# distinct release a test kernel's modules can sit next to the installed ones.
